   '|' per line, contents centered (if needed shifted one character to the right), and a missing
  countdown must be represented by '*'.
  - A blank line must be printed between turns for readability.
  - Adhere to the rules for variable, method, and package naming.
  - After printing an error message the program must continue and wait for the next input.
