  - System.exit(), Runtime.exit() and similar termination calls must not be used.
  - Use Java SE 17 as the only Java platform version.
  - Write program code in English.
  - In `show barn` and `show market` numbers must be right-aligned so the largest number is
  separated from all colon characters by exactly one space; only vegetables with count > 0 are shown
