    - ProgrammingWT2223-Final1 RELATES_TO Player actions and rules: Defined player actions and
  constraints: Plant (requires vegetable in Barn and valid empty tile type; starts tile countdown),
  Harvest (move chosen amount from one tile to Barn; manage tile countdown accordingly), Sell (sell
  any amount from Barn; market updates only after turn end), Buy Vegetable (purchase exactly one
  vegetable into Barn), Buy Land (draw top tile from shuffled deck, place left/right/above existing
  tile; costs Gold(T)=10·(ManhattanDistance(T,B)−1)).
    - ProgrammingWT2223-Final1 RELATES_TO Game end and victory conditions: Game end conditions: at
  the end of a round any child with Gold ≥ G_Win is a winner (all children meeting that threshold
  win); if none reach G_Win the child(ren) with the most gold win; players may also end the game by
  mutual decision.
