  <memories>
    - Queens Farming is a turn-based (rundenbasiertes) board/social game playable solo or
  multiplayer.
    - Actions: Plant (requires vegetable in barn, plant on suitable empty tile, starts crop-specific
   countdown), Harvest (move chosen amount from a tile to barn, remove or maintain/start countdown
  accordingly), Sell (sell any amount from barn; gold credited immediately; market updated after
  turn), Buy Vegetable (buy exactly one vegetable into barn), Buy Land (draw first tile from mixed
  remaining stack; place adjacent left/right/above; cost Gold(T)=10·(ManhattanDistance(T,B)−1)).
